; A rule that generates postings in two commodities leaves a residual in
; both after the re-verification (src/xact.cc:1677-1684,
; xact_base_t::verify at src/xact.cc:1040-1110).

= /Food/
    Assets:Points    1 PTS
    Income:Rebate    -0.10 USD

2026/01/01 lunch
    Expenses:Food    10.00 USD
    Assets:Cash

test bal -> 1
